  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 7105.05 Fee",
  "priorExpiration": "2017-06-30",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 7105.05 Fee.\n\n(a) The individual whose blood sample was drawn shall be responsible for payment of the administrative fee of $15.00 for the additional test.\n\n(b) Payment may be by credit card at the department, or by mailing a check or money order along with the individual’s name, address and date of additional test draw to:\n\nNew Hampshire State Police Forensic Laboratory\n\nAttention: Additional Test\n\n33 Hazen Drive\n\nConcord, NH 03305\n\nSource. #12064, INTERIM, eff 1-1-17, EXPIRES: 6-30-17; ss by #12216, eff 6-30-17",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/saf-c7100.html"
}
